        },
        "quote": "The following general operating requirements shall apply to all salvage yards:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "0cb4f219-8540-57d4-9fe7-aba593cd108e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 178,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:1",
          "start": 79
        },
        "quote": "(a) The permit issued pursuant to this chapter shall be plainly displayed on the business premises.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "52910461-fae3-57a9-94d6-360c8923df4e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 293,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:2",
          "start": 179
        },
        "quote": "(b) The salvage yard, together with things kept therein, shall at all times be maintained in a sanitary condition.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "fa215952-aeb7-5500-bc4c-5377c89adf47",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 373,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:3",
          "start": 294
        },
        "quote": "(c) No space not covered by the permit shall be used in the permitted business.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "1a27180e-67a6-5df2-8705-c8ef0d45fbf2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 502,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:4",
          "start": 374
        },
        "quote": "(d) No water shall be allowed to stand in any place on the premises in such manner as to afford a breeding place for mosquitoes.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "525f3ecc-3898-59b6-abc9-d153181ae5c9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 616,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:5",
          "start": 503
        },
        "quote": "(e) Weeds and vegetation on the premises, other than trees, shall be kept at a height of not more than 12 inches.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "8c0206b7-9cbe-5105-961f-c7efe39a298e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 852,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:6",
          "start": 617
        },
        "quote": "(f) No garbage or waste liable to give off a foul odor or attract vermin shall be kept on the premises; nor shall any refuse of any kind be kept on the premises, unless such refuse is junk and is used in the permitted salvage business.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "ca5c14f5-e36f-5dd4-8287-bc29f50a3166",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1012,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:7",
          "start": 853
        },
        "quote": "(g) Junk shall be stored in piles not exceeding 10 feet in height and shall be arranged so as to permit easy access to all such junk for firefighting purposes.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "35dbe1a2-f599-551c-aa0d-43815c0f512f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1196,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:8",
          "start": 1013
        },
        "quote": "(h) No combustible material of any kind not necessary or beneficial to the permitted business shall be kept on the premises; nor shall the premises be allowed to become a fire hazard.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "c0902db9-684b-5ba7-b16c-b9d153409239",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1303,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:9",
          "start": 1197
        },
        "quote": "(i) Gasoline and oil shall be removed from any dismantled or scrapped engines or vehicles on the premises.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 5.135.060 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "61b919f5-f58a-5cfb-aa9a-5a3aa2806b0e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1510,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:10",
          "start": 1304
        },
        "quote": "(j) No junk or other material shall be burned on the premises except in accordance with Kansas Administrative Regulations 28-19-40 through 28-19-43 , as amended. (Code 1981 § 38-101.1. Code 1995 § 114-155.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.135.060:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
